WEBVTT

00:00:04.390 --> 00:00:05.940
Here, “Aaah!”

00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:09.520
Here, Irie-kun.

00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:11.610
No! I wanna give it!

00:00:13.530 --> 00:00:15.110
Here, Papa, “Aaah!”

00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:18.950
Mama, you dummy!

00:00:18.950 --> 00:00:21.540
You live and you learn, Mi-chan!

00:00:22.910 --> 00:00:24.250
Come on now...

00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:28.670
Kotomi, you have another, right?

00:00:28.670 --> 00:00:29.880
Come on.

00:00:30.340 --> 00:00:31.920
Here, Papa.

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:33.420
Thank you.

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:35.510
You’re welcome.

00:00:38.350 --> 00:00:41.470
Are we at your grandpa’s house yet?

00:00:41.470 --> 00:00:43.480
Just a bit more.

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:47.270
Speaking of which,
I wonder if <i>he</i> is still there.

00:00:47.980 --> 00:00:49.270
He?

00:00:49.690 --> 00:00:51.980
You’re closer to him after all.

00:00:51.980 --> 00:00:54.240
You should introduce me to him this time.

00:00:56.360 --> 00:00:59.370
That was during the first summer after our marriage.

00:00:59.990 --> 00:01:02.950
It was the first time I rode on this train.

00:01:02.950 --> 00:01:06.370
It was an unforgettable and strange experience.

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:13.260
I never once dreamed that you would plan a trip for us!

00:01:13.260 --> 00:01:16.550
I’m so lucky to have such
a kind husband.

00:01:16.550 --> 00:01:19.010
I can’t believe you can still say that after all your begging and pleading.

00:01:19.010 --> 00:01:22.100
Irie-kun, what places are we going to visit in Kyuushuu?

00:01:22.100 --> 00:01:24.810
What about our hotel?
Isn’t it about time you told me?

00:01:24.810 --> 00:01:26.770
Just wait and see.

00:01:26.770 --> 00:01:29.400
Isn’t it enough that we get to spend two weeks together?

00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:31.400
Of course!

00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:33.900
I don’t care where it is, as long as we’re alone together.

00:01:39.570 --> 00:01:41.410
Irie-kun...

00:01:41.410 --> 00:01:44.740
Is there a hotel around here?

00:01:45.540 --> 00:01:47.750
There’s not a soul in sight...

00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:50.580
Yeah, we’re alone, right?

00:01:51.130 --> 00:01:52.710
That’s not what I meant.

00:01:52.710 --> 00:01:54.250
We have to walk a bit more.

00:01:54.710 --> 00:01:55.970
Ah, wait!

00:01:59.260 --> 00:02:04.060
Umm, Irie-kun...
This is a normal house, isn’t it?

00:02:04.060 --> 00:02:05.140
Yeah.

00:02:05.140 --> 00:02:07.640
I see, a boarding house?

00:02:07.640 --> 00:02:10.650
That’s good, it’ll be more homely.

00:02:11.230 --> 00:02:12.980
This is my mother’s home.

00:03:54.380 --> 00:03:57.430
Sorry for the late introduction.

00:03:57.430 --> 00:03:59.390
This is my wife, Kotoko.

00:03:59.390 --> 00:04:02.560
I’m Kotoko. Pleased to meet you all!

00:04:02.560 --> 00:04:05.060
I’m going to introduce everyone, so please remember.

00:04:05.060 --> 00:04:05.900
Right.

00:04:06.270 --> 00:04:07.520
Firstly, my grandmother.

00:04:07.520 --> 00:04:09.900
Thank you for visiting, Kotoko-san.

00:04:09.900 --> 00:04:11.400
My uncle, Keizo.

00:04:11.940 --> 00:04:13.400
His eldest daughter, Megu.

00:04:13.820 --> 00:04:15.520
His eldest son, Take.

00:04:15.520 --> 00:04:17.160
Second son, Toshi.

00:04:17.160 --> 00:04:18.820
This is my aunt, Akiko.

00:04:18.820 --> 00:04:20.660
Her eldest daughter, Maki.

00:04:20.660 --> 00:04:23.530
Her younger brothers, Hiro and Yasu, twins.

00:04:23.910 --> 00:04:25.670
Next to them, my aunt, Hiroko.

00:04:25.960 --> 00:04:27.420
Eldest daughter, Miki.

00:04:27.420 --> 00:04:28.630
Second daughter, Yuki.

00:04:29.590 --> 00:04:31.460
And first son, Ken.

00:04:32.420 --> 00:04:34.970
They all look the same!

00:04:34.970 --> 00:04:36.670
I can’t remember!

00:04:38.510 --> 00:04:42.640
Naoki-niichan, didn’t you tell us that she was a real beauty?

00:04:42.640 --> 00:04:45.890
Your eyes must have gone bad from living in Tokyo too long, right, Nii-chan?

00:04:45.890 --> 00:04:48.560
She doesn’t look too bright either.

00:04:48.560 --> 00:04:52.650
Not only do they look like Irie-kun, but their personalities are rather similar too, aren’t they?

00:04:52.650 --> 00:04:53.650
Be quiet!

00:04:56.360 --> 00:04:58.360
Long time no see, Grandpa.

00:04:58.360 --> 00:05:00.870
Naoki, is this your wife?

00:05:00.870 --> 00:05:01.620
Yes.

00:05:01.620 --> 00:05:03.870
Nice to meet you. I’m Kotoko.

00:05:05.870 --> 00:05:08.250
That’s not a very bright looking face.

00:05:08.750 --> 00:05:10.540
And this hand...

00:05:10.880 --> 00:05:14.550
This hand has never done housework before! That ain’t right!

00:05:14.550 --> 00:05:17.380
I don’t believe you’re suitable to marry into the Isshiki family.

00:05:17.380 --> 00:05:20.050
Grandpa, you’re scaring Kotoko-san.

00:05:20.050 --> 00:05:24.810
In my eyes, she’s completely unfit to be Naoki’s wife!

00:05:24.810 --> 00:05:25.850
I disapprove!

00:05:25.850 --> 00:05:29.270
All right then! While you’re here, I’ll beat you into shape!

00:05:30.190 --> 00:05:31.270
Irie-kun!

00:05:31.270 --> 00:05:34.190
Well, it’s no use arguing with him.

00:05:34.190 --> 00:05:37.280
Good luck.

00:05:40.160 --> 00:05:41.030
Okay...

00:05:45.290 --> 00:05:45.900
Hey!

00:05:46.500 --> 00:05:48.920
What kind of careless way
of picking is that?!

00:05:48.920 --> 00:05:51.790
What’s wrong with the way
I pick the fruits?!

00:05:51.790 --> 00:05:53.670
How long are you going to complain?!

00:05:53.670 --> 00:05:55.510
Quit yapping and move your hands instead!

00:05:55.510 --> 00:05:57.220
When you’re done with that, it’s on to the eggplants!

00:05:57.920 --> 00:05:59.340
There’s still more?

00:06:01.090 --> 00:06:03.050
How did it turn out like this?

00:06:03.050 --> 00:06:07.020
Where has my passionate summer with Irie-kun gone to?

00:06:10.480 --> 00:06:12.230
My hips...

00:06:12.230 --> 00:06:14.020
Must be because I was halfway
bent over all day...

00:06:14.020 --> 00:06:17.440
Kotoko-san, it’s No-chan from Tokyo.

00:06:17.440 --> 00:06:19.190
No-chan?

00:06:20.320 --> 00:06:21.360
Hello?

00:06:21.360 --> 00:06:22.530
Kotoko-chan?

00:06:22.530 --> 00:06:24.330
Hello?

00:06:24.330 --> 00:06:25.290
Mother!

00:06:25.290 --> 00:06:27.830
As I suspected, you’re really there.

00:06:27.830 --> 00:06:30.500
I had a bad feeling
when he mentioned Kyuushuu.

00:06:30.500 --> 00:06:32.250
That’s Onii-chan, sheesh!

00:06:32.250 --> 00:06:36.210
Are you all right? Has my father or my nieces and nephews done anything mean to you?

00:06:36.630 --> 00:06:40.010
Mother! I want to go ho–

00:06:40.590 --> 00:06:41.720
Is that you, Noriko?

00:06:41.720 --> 00:06:44.470
I’m so glad Kotoko came.

00:06:44.470 --> 00:06:47.020
Naoki is such a lucky guy.

00:06:47.720 --> 00:06:50.020
Come on, you don’t have to worry!

00:06:50.020 --> 00:06:51.230
Okay, good night!

00:06:52.770 --> 00:06:56.690
Noriko would definitely come here if I didn’t tell her that.

00:06:56.690 --> 00:06:58.150
I can’t let that happen.

00:06:58.150 --> 00:07:00.190
Hurry and take your bath and sleep.

00:07:00.190 --> 00:07:02.280
We have another early day tomorrow.

00:07:04.070 --> 00:07:06.280
Why that mean old geezer!

00:07:10.410 --> 00:07:12.120
Hey, you look well.

00:07:12.870 --> 00:07:15.590
Irie-kun, where have you been all this time?

00:07:15.590 --> 00:07:17.710
Well, this is a great place to study.

00:07:17.710 --> 00:07:19.120
Hence, I’ve made good progress.

00:07:19.800 --> 00:07:23.550
And what about being alone together? Liar.

00:07:23.550 --> 00:07:26.140
I wanted to show you this place
at least once.

00:07:26.640 --> 00:07:28.640
This is the countryside where I was from.

00:07:29.520 --> 00:07:31.010
Irie-kun...

00:07:32.600 --> 00:07:37.650
Irie-kun looks so cool when he watches the star-filled sky.

00:07:37.650 --> 00:07:41.020
Maybe it was a good thing that I came along.

00:07:42.070 --> 00:07:43.570
Naoki-niisan!

00:07:44.030 --> 00:07:45.740
We’re not disturbing you, are we?

00:07:45.740 --> 00:07:47.160
No problem. What is it?

00:07:47.160 --> 00:07:48.700
You <i>are</i> disturbing us!

00:07:48.700 --> 00:07:52.330
Actually, we wanted to throw Kotoko-neechan a welcoming party.

00:07:52.330 --> 00:07:53.750
Welcoming party?

00:07:53.750 --> 00:07:58.000
After all, you’re Naoki-niichan’s lovely wife.

00:07:58.000 --> 00:07:59.250
We’re relatives now.

00:07:59.250 --> 00:08:01.970
Everyone’s waiting, so let’s hurry and go.

00:08:01.970 --> 00:08:03.260
Guys...

00:08:04.090 --> 00:08:05.550
Hurry up.

00:08:05.550 --> 00:08:07.890
Irie-kun, sorry. I’ll be back later.

00:08:09.600 --> 00:08:10.960
Take your time.

00:08:12.390 --> 00:08:15.350
The following is a story passed down through the Isshiki family.

00:08:15.970 --> 00:08:21.900
Ten generations ago, the wife of the head of the Isshiki family committed adultery with one of the servants.

00:08:21.900 --> 00:08:25.740
The master killed both his wife and that man with a sword.

00:08:25.740 --> 00:08:28.320
How is this a welcoming party?

00:08:28.320 --> 00:08:32.160
She hated the master greatly.

00:08:32.160 --> 00:08:37.460
“I curse the wife, ten generations from now, who enters the Isshiki family.”

00:08:37.460 --> 00:08:40.380
Those were her last words.

00:08:40.960 --> 00:08:44.970
And, the wife ten generations later is...

00:08:44.970 --> 00:08:48.470
It’s you, Kotoko-san!

00:08:49.260 --> 00:08:51.140
Irie-kun!

00:08:55.100 --> 00:08:57.270
Hey, Irie-kun...

00:08:57.270 --> 00:08:59.980
Do you want to go to the toilet
or something?

00:08:59.980 --> 00:09:01.270
No.

00:09:01.270 --> 00:09:04.070
I’m not going to follow you, since you’re not a kid any more.

00:09:09.120 --> 00:09:11.830
Why are halls in the countryside so dark?

00:09:11.830 --> 00:09:14.000
Eh? Which way was it to the toilet again?

00:09:14.000 --> 00:09:18.420
“I curse the wife, ten generations from now, who enters the Isshiki family.”

00:09:18.420 --> 00:09:21.710
Those kids probably made up
that story anyway...

00:09:21.710 --> 00:09:23.000
What are you doing?

00:09:25.340 --> 00:09:29.760
Oh, so the toilet was right
in front of our room.

00:09:29.760 --> 00:09:33.970
Grandpa, please wait here until I come out. You must!

00:09:42.770 --> 00:09:44.320
I’m going home!

00:09:45.030 --> 00:09:49.990
I wanted to have a fun trip
with just the two of us!

00:09:49.990 --> 00:09:53.200
They’re all so mean to me, and they scared the living daylights out of me!

00:09:53.200 --> 00:09:54.870
I hate this place!

00:09:55.830 --> 00:09:58.000
I was born here.

00:09:58.580 --> 00:10:01.790
I was his first grandchild,
so he cared for me a lot.

00:10:01.790 --> 00:10:05.340
He often told me that he’d choose a wife for me when I was young.

00:10:06.210 --> 00:10:11.760
So actually, I wanted to introduce you to him before we got married and receive his blessing.

00:10:11.760 --> 00:10:14.510
I was sure that he’d approve of you.

00:10:14.970 --> 00:10:17.560
You’re the girl I chose after all.

00:10:18.520 --> 00:10:19.770
Irie-kun...

00:10:19.770 --> 00:10:23.650
But, if you insist on going home, then I can’t stop you.

00:10:23.650 --> 00:10:25.770
Who said I was going home?

00:10:25.770 --> 00:10:30.530
I’m going to enjoy myself here for the next two weeks!

00:10:33.030 --> 00:10:35.910
Just watch, Irie-kun. I won’t lose!

00:10:35.910 --> 00:10:39.830
I’ll become the perfect wife which Grandpa would approve of!

00:10:42.110 --> 00:10:45.910
Just as I expected of you Kotoko. You got Grandpa’s approval!

00:10:46.950 --> 00:10:49.750
If it’s for you, then nothing is impossible!

00:10:51.210 --> 00:10:52.540
Oww!

00:10:55.250 --> 00:10:57.880
What kind of wife sleeps in this much?

00:10:57.880 --> 00:10:59.720
Sorry...

00:11:02.260 --> 00:11:03.800
My legs!

00:11:05.600 --> 00:11:08.100
Insolent girl!
Can’t feel my legs...

00:11:26.700 --> 00:11:32.250
Even if this is for Irie-kun, I’ll die before I get
Grandpa’s approval if I have to do this everyday.

00:11:32.250 --> 00:11:34.630
Kotoko-san.

00:11:35.090 --> 00:11:37.130
Come here and rest for a bit.

00:11:39.840 --> 00:11:41.880
It’s Irie-kun! How adorable!

00:11:42.430 --> 00:11:44.850
I’m sorry about how Grandpa has been treating you.

00:11:44.850 --> 00:11:48.350
He’s just jealous that you’ve taken Naoki from him.

00:11:49.480 --> 00:11:52.940
Just try to bear with it a little longer.

00:11:53.770 --> 00:11:55.770
Jealous, eh?

00:11:55.770 --> 00:11:58.440
Grandpa has a cute side as well.

00:12:00.650 --> 00:12:02.490
Irie-kun...

00:12:02.490 --> 00:12:04.160
I’m not going with you.

00:12:04.620 --> 00:12:08.160
How mean! What if a ghost appears?

00:12:09.910 --> 00:12:13.210
You again, Grandpa?
Don’t scare me like that!

00:12:13.210 --> 00:12:14.630
I should be the one saying that!

00:12:14.630 --> 00:12:18.460
The tenth generation curse has already scared me enough.

00:12:18.460 --> 00:12:20.640
Tenth generation curse? What’s that?

00:12:20.640 --> 00:12:22.170
You know about it too, don’t you?

00:12:22.170 --> 00:12:26.260
The one about the tenth generation patriarch killing his adulterous wife and her lover!

00:12:26.260 --> 00:12:28.850
What the heck?! Who told you that?

00:12:28.850 --> 00:12:30.140
It was Ken-chan.

00:12:30.140 --> 00:12:31.560
Ken is the baby.

00:12:31.560 --> 00:12:33.190
Oh, is he?

00:12:33.190 --> 00:12:36.230
It was the red-headed high schooler.

00:12:36.230 --> 00:12:38.190
So, it was Take? How dare he say such things!

00:12:38.860 --> 00:12:40.570
Ah, I’m tired of this!

00:12:40.570 --> 00:12:43.160
Okay, I’m going to tell you
something really good.

00:12:43.780 --> 00:12:45.410
Something good?

00:12:47.620 --> 00:12:50.750
He was really into it last night.

00:12:50.750 --> 00:12:54.170
Grandpa seems so much easier
to talk to at night.

00:12:54.170 --> 00:12:55.960
Kotoko-san, can you come here a sec?

00:13:00.920 --> 00:13:04.220
We’re planning on doing our summer homework together now.

00:13:04.220 --> 00:13:05.880
Eh? Homework?

00:13:05.880 --> 00:13:08.260
There are so many parts I don’t understand.

00:13:08.260 --> 00:13:10.680
So, I’d like you to teach me.

00:13:10.680 --> 00:13:14.350
We’re talking about
Naoki-niichan’s wife after all.

00:13:14.350 --> 00:13:16.770
You’re smarter than us, right?

00:13:16.770 --> 00:13:17.980
Irie-kun...

00:13:17.980 --> 00:13:19.860
Why not? Just teach them.

00:13:19.860 --> 00:13:20.900
You’re kidding...

00:13:20.900 --> 00:13:23.440
Let’s get right to it then.
Year 1 high school math.

00:13:23.440 --> 00:13:24.990
You’ll be able to solve it in under ten seconds, right?

00:13:24.990 --> 00:13:26.070
Mine is science.

00:13:26.070 --> 00:13:27.160
Mine is world history.

00:13:27.160 --> 00:13:28.370
Teach me too!

00:13:28.370 --> 00:13:29.620
Me, me!

00:13:29.620 --> 00:13:31.200
Me too!

00:13:31.200 --> 00:13:34.540
These kids are planning to make a fool out of me, aren’t they?

00:13:34.540 --> 00:13:38.040
Very well, if that’s what you’re trying to pull...

00:13:38.460 --> 00:13:39.460
Take-chan.

00:13:39.460 --> 00:13:40.420
What is it?

00:13:40.420 --> 00:13:43.840
I don’t know the answer to that question...

00:13:43.840 --> 00:13:45.930
...but I do know one thing.

00:13:46.930 --> 00:13:51.930
During your middle school field trip, you were crying for Mommy at night, weren’t you?

00:13:54.390 --> 00:13:55.890
What are you saying?

00:13:55.890 --> 00:13:56.980
Who told you?

00:13:56.980 --> 00:13:58.480
Is it true, Take?

00:13:58.480 --> 00:14:00.610
Even though you look like such a tough guy.

00:14:00.610 --> 00:14:02.400
Even you, Naoki-niichan!

00:14:02.400 --> 00:14:04.360
Damn it!

00:14:04.360 --> 00:14:06.570
Take-niichan is a Mama’s boy!

00:14:06.570 --> 00:14:09.450
Laugh while you can, Miki-chan.

00:14:09.450 --> 00:14:10.450
What?

00:14:10.450 --> 00:14:14.830
During your year 3 athletic meet, the rubber on your bloomers became loose.

00:14:15.960 --> 00:14:19.580
Ah, I’ll go pluck the tomatoes for you!

00:14:19.580 --> 00:14:21.790
I’ll go clean the chicken coop!

00:14:21.790 --> 00:14:24.630
I’ll go hang up the laundry for you!

00:14:24.630 --> 00:14:26.970
I’ll go cut the wood for the bath!

00:14:26.970 --> 00:14:29.470
Really? Thanks guys!

00:14:31.850 --> 00:14:33.560
Not bad...

00:14:33.560 --> 00:14:35.560
Right? It’s all thanks to Grandpa.

00:14:37.560 --> 00:14:39.190
Grandpa!

00:14:40.030 --> 00:14:41.190
I did it!

00:14:41.190 --> 00:14:42.900
I managed to turn the tables on them!

00:14:42.900 --> 00:14:45.070
It’s all thanks to what you told me last night!

00:14:45.360 --> 00:14:47.030
Huh? Last night?

00:14:47.030 --> 00:14:49.570
Quit talking nonsense and get to work!

00:14:49.570 --> 00:14:51.530
Why?

00:14:51.530 --> 00:14:54.080
Does he have a split personality?

00:14:57.330 --> 00:15:00.580
Seriously, ever since that girl came here...

00:15:00.580 --> 00:15:02.920
Why don’t you just approve of her already?

00:15:02.920 --> 00:15:06.920
Kotoko-san may not be the sharpest tool in the shed, but she’s very diligent.

00:15:06.920 --> 00:15:09.800
Why are you two suddenly on her side?

00:15:10.340 --> 00:15:12.510
I still don’t approve of...

00:15:13.930 --> 00:15:15.060
That’s it!

00:15:17.020 --> 00:15:18.810
There’s one way.

00:15:20.350 --> 00:15:22.020
Huh? Akebia picking?

00:15:22.020 --> 00:15:25.300
Grandpa, that’s just impossible!

00:15:25.300 --> 00:15:28.030
But, none of us have ever managed to find those Akebia behind the hills.

00:15:29.140 --> 00:15:31.700
There’s only one road,
so you won’t get lost.

00:15:31.700 --> 00:15:34.780
I’d like to eat those Akebia at least once more before I die.

00:15:34.780 --> 00:15:36.870
If you can bring me some...

00:15:36.870 --> 00:15:38.160
If I can?

00:15:38.160 --> 00:15:40.250
...I’ll approve of you as Naoki’s wife.

00:15:41.870 --> 00:15:42.790
Really?

00:15:42.790 --> 00:15:45.210
Yes. A man from Kyuushuu never goes back on his word.

00:15:45.210 --> 00:15:46.630
I’ll go!

00:15:46.630 --> 00:15:47.760
You’d better not.

00:15:47.760 --> 00:15:52.180
I can imagine you getting lost immediately even though there’s only one road.

00:15:52.180 --> 00:15:53.390
No, I <i>will</i> do it!

00:15:53.930 --> 00:15:57.830
It might be impossible to become good at cooking or sewing and such overnight, but...

00:15:57.830 --> 00:15:59.520
...even I should be able to do this.

00:15:59.520 --> 00:16:01.400
This is a lucky chance!

00:16:01.730 --> 00:16:02.810
Sheesh.

00:16:03.400 --> 00:16:05.400
You’re really something else.

00:16:07.780 --> 00:16:09.320
I’ll be going now then.

00:16:09.320 --> 00:16:10.900
Wait for me, Grandpa.

00:16:10.900 --> 00:16:12.740
We’re going to have an Akebia party tonight!

00:16:12.740 --> 00:16:14.780
I’ll do my best, Irie-kun!

00:16:14.780 --> 00:16:17.790
She’ll probably give up soon and come back anyway.

00:16:17.790 --> 00:16:22.120
I wonder about that. I don’t think you should underestimate her, Grandpa.

00:16:22.580 --> 00:16:25.080
She managed to win me over after all.

00:16:43.390 --> 00:16:46.520
How is this a single road?

00:16:50.650 --> 00:16:52.030
What should I do?

00:16:52.030 --> 00:16:54.240
I can’t find the Akebia.

00:16:54.240 --> 00:16:56.160
I don’t know how to get back either.

00:16:56.820 --> 00:17:01.700
It’s all over; I won’t be approved
as Irie-kun’s wife.

00:17:01.700 --> 00:17:04.670
I’m sorry, Irie-kun. I’m so sorry.

00:17:06.920 --> 00:17:10.130
I figured that this would happen.

00:17:11.550 --> 00:17:12.840
Grandpa?

00:17:22.560 --> 00:17:23.770
This looks like it.

00:17:24.230 --> 00:17:27.650
Incredible! So this is Akebia?

00:17:27.650 --> 00:17:29.480
Come on, hurry and pick them.

00:17:31.980 --> 00:17:35.820
Eh, but why did you show me the way?

00:17:36.240 --> 00:17:38.450
Do you approve of me?

00:17:39.490 --> 00:17:43.790
Well, I admit that you have a lot of spunk despite not being too bright.

00:17:43.790 --> 00:17:46.290
You might just be the perfect match for Naoki.

00:17:47.210 --> 00:17:48.840
Grandpa...

00:17:48.840 --> 00:17:51.300
He actually knows this as well.

00:17:51.300 --> 00:17:52.250
He?

00:17:52.250 --> 00:17:55.840
Please bring your baby the next time you come here.

00:17:56.590 --> 00:17:58.010
Baby?

00:17:58.010 --> 00:18:00.800
Come on, stop spacing out
and pick the fruits.

00:18:00.800 --> 00:18:02.010
Of course.

00:18:02.970 --> 00:18:04.350
Thank goodness.

00:18:04.350 --> 00:18:08.400
I would have been completely lost if you hadn’t come.

00:18:08.400 --> 00:18:09.360
Kotoko!

00:18:10.980 --> 00:18:12.360
Kotoko!

00:18:12.360 --> 00:18:14.110
Ah, Irie-kun!

00:18:14.110 --> 00:18:15.440
I’m so glad you’re safe.

00:18:15.440 --> 00:18:17.070
How did you do so well on your own?

00:18:17.070 --> 00:18:18.370
It’s because Grandpa...

00:18:20.410 --> 00:18:22.120
Where did he go?

00:18:22.620 --> 00:18:24.750
Did he go home ahead of us?

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:29.670
Those Akebia look really good!

00:18:29.670 --> 00:18:31.290
You’re amazing, Kotoko-san!

00:18:31.290 --> 00:18:33.210
Fantastic! Amazing!

00:18:33.210 --> 00:18:34.800
Well done finding them!

00:18:34.800 --> 00:18:37.470
So, no more complaints, right, Grandpa?

00:18:42.180 --> 00:18:43.390
Grandpa.

00:18:45.470 --> 00:18:47.480
Well done, Kotoko-san.

00:18:47.480 --> 00:18:49.650
I tip my cap to your determination.

00:18:49.650 --> 00:18:51.860
Please take care of Naoki.

00:18:52.690 --> 00:18:54.030
I did it!

00:18:54.820 --> 00:18:57.490
Irie-kun, I did it!

00:18:57.490 --> 00:18:59.320
Sheesh, have you no sense of shame?

00:18:59.320 --> 00:19:00.820
Grandpa!

00:19:00.820 --> 00:19:03.330
Thank you for always helping me in secret!

00:19:04.280 --> 00:19:05.450
What are you talking about?

00:19:05.450 --> 00:19:07.790
Naoki, what did you tell her?

00:19:07.790 --> 00:19:09.420
Well...

00:19:09.420 --> 00:19:12.290
It’s a bit too late to be acting shy now!

00:19:12.290 --> 00:19:14.090
Just what’s going on?

00:19:14.590 --> 00:19:17.420
Grandpa secretly went to the mountains...

00:19:17.420 --> 00:19:21.220
...to guide me to the Akebia tree because I got lost.

00:19:21.220 --> 00:19:23.100
Huh? Me?

00:19:23.100 --> 00:19:26.220
Grandpa had been with us in the house the whole time.

00:19:27.100 --> 00:19:30.440
You’re kidding! But he looked exactly...

00:19:32.150 --> 00:19:34.150
You don’t have a mole on your cheek!

00:19:34.150 --> 00:19:36.690
He had a very large mole too!

00:19:40.570 --> 00:19:43.160
A large mole on the face?

00:19:43.160 --> 00:19:45.620
So, the Grandpa she was talking about...

00:19:46.330 --> 00:19:47.160
What is it?

00:19:49.960 --> 00:19:51.830
That’s it! This is him!

00:19:51.830 --> 00:19:57.090
He was the master of this family ten generations ago, Isshiki Kikunosuke.

00:19:58.510 --> 00:20:02.300
Ten generations ago... The one who killed his wife and her lover?

00:20:02.300 --> 00:20:06.180
What? I’m pretty sure that
Kikunosuke-san’s wife ran away.

00:20:06.180 --> 00:20:08.060
But, that’s nothing to be scared of.

00:20:08.060 --> 00:20:12.350
Besides, he passed away
more than 200 years ago.

00:20:15.810 --> 00:20:18.320
But... but... I talked with him a lot at night.

00:20:18.320 --> 00:20:20.740
He was the one who told me about everyones’ secrets too.

00:20:20.740 --> 00:20:22.570
A ghost!

00:20:22.570 --> 00:20:24.410
You always see him?!

00:20:24.410 --> 00:20:25.740
Dear Buddha!

00:20:25.740 --> 00:20:28.240
Irie-kun!

00:20:29.160 --> 00:20:31.750
Please bring your baby the next time you come here.

00:20:46.720 --> 00:20:48.220
Mi-chan!

00:20:48.850 --> 00:20:50.970
Don’t run, it’s dangerous!

00:20:55.650 --> 00:20:57.240
Mi-chan, are you okay?

00:21:00.610 --> 00:21:02.570
Well done getting here.

00:21:06.160 --> 00:21:07.240
You see...

00:21:26.180 --> 00:21:29.100
We’re here!
